WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.056
In role-play, expression, voice, gesture and turn-taking help an audience understand

00:00:05.056 --> 00:00:05.939
a character.

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:11.943
Which detail belongs in a short retelling? Answer: The central problem and how it was

00:00:11.943 --> 00:00:12.287
solved.

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:17.789
Act out a short market scene with a partner; use two voices and matching actions.

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:22.158
Discuss why: Important events help the retelling make sense.
